&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Sr &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Director, Integrated Analytics Partner &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Product Analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;San Mateo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;, CA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Remote also considered. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;At&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;apple-converted-space&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;2fd183b4-ad5c-5199-9fc7-89a6d0356079|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Cambria&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Cambria&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Cambria,Arial,ＭＳ 明朝&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;apple-converted-space&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;apple-converted-space&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) PlayStation, we create unforgettable gaming experiences—and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; just as committed to building a world-class team. As a leader in interactive entertainment, PlayStation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;operates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt; a massive scale, supporting millions of players worldwide and processing billions of transactions annually across our digital ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Senior Director, Integrated Analytics Partner – Platform &amp;amp; Product Analytics to serve as the strategic analytics leader embedded within both our Platform Strategy &amp;amp; Product Management organizations. This role is responsible for defining and executing the analytics strategy that helps inform our long-term platform strategy, provides Product Management analytics in support of the ongoing evolution of our player experience, as well as competitive intelligence across the enterprise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As the primary analytics partner to Platform Strategy &amp;amp; Product Management leadership, this role will translate business priorities into a coordinated analytics portfolio across Reporting, Applied Analytics, and Data Science. The Senior Director will directly lead the Applied Analytics team while providing strategic direction to the Data Science and Reporting squads aligned to Platform &amp;amp; Product initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate for this role combines a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;demonstrated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; ability to drive change at scale through the application of analytics, an exceptionally strong strategic orientation, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;depth of understanding of the Product Management function and how the application of analytics, including rigorous testing, can improve &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;the consumer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; experience. Boundless curiosity, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;creativity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; and enthusiasm for envisioning and then shaping the future, in a complex category that is ever evolving, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;is a welcome trait. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;PlayStation may be a market leader, but the analytics team is filled with people &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;who are obsessed with improving in every area we can, care deeply about their role in catalyzing the success of our stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;our partners &amp;amp; creators, and, most importantly, improving the experiences of our players&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; cultivating the joy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; gaming. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;This role will provide a unique perspective on the future of gaming—and, for the right person, the ability to help shape it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
